# ==============================================================================
# Claude Code Ignore File (.claudeignore)
# Protects secrets & token budget for Claude CLI
# ==============================================================================

# Secrets & Credentials
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.keystore
**/id_rsa*
**/secrets.json

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/**
**/vendor/**
**/.venv/**
**/__pycache__/**

# Build Outputs
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/.next/**
**/target/**
**/bin/**
**/obj/**

# Logs & Locks
**/*.log
**/*.lock
**/package-lock.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/poetry.lock
**/Cargo.lock
**/coverage/**
